{"id":"xirdalan","qid":"Q642109","category":"city","type":"oikonym","names":{"az":"Xırdalan","ru":"Хырдалан","en":"Khyrdalan"},"coordinates":[49.75639,40.44861],"coordinatesSource":"wd","region":"abseron-xizi","regionSource":"wp-az-regions","admin":[{"qid":"Q179538","az":"Abşeron rayonu","en":"Absheron District"},{"qid":"Q864153","az":"Binəqədi rayonu","en":"Binagadi raion"}],"firstRecord":{"year":1901,"precision":"century","century":20,"bce":false,"kind":"first-mention","source":"wp-ru"},"period":"modern","forms":[],"namedAfter":[],"etymology":[{"lang":"en","heading":"Etymology","text":"The name \"Khirdalan\" has various interpretations. One theory suggests it derives from \"khir dali,\" meaning \"a field from the sowing ground.\" Another interpretation links it to the word \"khur,\" meaning \"unusual fire.\" Some believe the name comes from a combination of \"khyrd\" and \"field.\" It is also said that the name arose due to Khirdalan's location along a caravan route—where merchants traveling to Baku would rest in caravanserais and trade in the local market.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-en","anchor":"Etymology"}],"summary":{"az":{"text":"Xırdalan — Azərbaycan Respublikasının Abşeron rayonunun Xırdalan şəhər inzibati ərazi dairəsində şəhər, Abşeron rayonunun inzibati mərkəzi.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-az"},"ru":{"text":"Хырдала́н (азерб. Xırdalan) — город в Азербайджане, административный центр Апшеронского (Абшеронского) района. Расположен в западной части Абшеронского полуострова, в 5 километрах к северо-западу от Баку.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-ru"},"en":{"text":"Khirdalan (Azerbaijani: Xırdalan) is a city, municipality, and the capital of the Absheron District of Azerbaijan. The city is home to the country's biggest brewery, Baltika-Baku, formerly known as Khyrdalan. Khirdalan gained city status on 29 November 2006 after its approval by the National Assembly of Azerbaijan. A monument to Egyptian president Hosni Mubarak was erected in 2007 in the city. Similarly, a statue of Heydar Aliyev was erected in Cairo in 2008.","truncated":true,"source":"wp-en"}},"images":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/26/Heydar_Aliyev_park_in_Xirdalan.jpg/960px-Heydar_Aliyev_park_in_Xirdalan.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","small":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/26/Heydar_Aliyev_park_in_Xirdalan.jpg/960px-Heydar_Aliyev_park_in_Xirdalan.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","width":800,"height":600,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Heydar_Aliyev_park_in_Xirdalan.jpg","title":"Heydar Aliyev park in Xirdalan.jpg","artist":"Искендеров Рауф","credit":"Own work","license":"CC BY-SA 2.5","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.5","source":"img-1"}],"sources":[{"id":"wd","kind":"wikidata","title":"Wikidata Q642109: Khyrdalan","publisher":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q642109","licence":"CC0 1.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Xırdalan","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=X%C4%B1rdalan&oldid=9199396","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/X%C4%B1rdalan","revid":9199396,"revDate":"2026-11-15","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-ru","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"ru","title":"Хырдалан","publisher":"Википедия (на русском)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%D0%A5%D1%8B%D1%80%D0%B4%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%BD&oldid=155515421","pageUrl":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A5%D1%8B%D1%80%D0%B4%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%BD","revid":155515421,"revDate":"2026-10-09","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-en","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"en","title":"Khirdalan","publisher":"Wikipedia (English)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Khirdalan&oldid=1376411848","pageUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.o